    "body": "So, per DOM, it's wrong: setting `classList` should [PutForwards=value] and directly set `class` content attribute to passing value \" a a b \", but here I see \"a b\". But at least tokens in set are correct.\nhttps://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-domtokenlist-value\nThis behaviour fianlly cames from merging DOMSettableTokenList into DOMTokenList https://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues/119 \n",
