    "body": "@annevk If https://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues/105 also fix (clarify) this case https://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues/201#issuecomment-208049965 then you can close. Due  https://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues/201#issuecomment-206301673 Safari Technology Preview make progress here, but still not correct per spec.. I still look implementation of this at least in one engine in Windows (even in dev version). Observing the progress of work in this area I wondering why you want change DOMTokenList stringifier, now DOM describe behaviour of Edge/IE/Blink/Gecko vs alone Webkit, so what change requires less effort?\n",
